WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝给我亲一下
You: Good baby, give me a kiss.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.460
咪亲好了。咪做到了。
Mmwah. Done. Mii did it.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.780
多摸几下。然后咪去做早饭。
More pats. Then Mii makes breakfast.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：起床，跟咪去厨房
You: Get up and follow Mate to the kitchen.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.060
起来啦！跟咪走。
Up you get! Follow Mii.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.790
早餐开始。咪是大厨。
Breakfast starts. Mii is the chef.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：让咪给吐司抹果酱
You: Let Mate spread jam on the toast.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.780
果酱时间。咪准备好了。
Jam time. Mii is ready.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:14.460
咪试了下。不是故意的。
Mii tested it. Not on purpose.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：拿起吐司咬一口
You: Pick up the toast and take a bite.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.990
趁热吃。
Eat it while it's warm.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.000
好吃吗？咪很努力的。
How is it? Mii worked hard.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：不吃了，我想出去玩
You: I'm done eating. I want to go out and play.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.060
出去玩？咪愿意！
Out to play? Mii is in!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.440
公园！咪找到一个球。
Park! Mii found a ball.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.950
和咪一起追它吧！
Chase it with Mii!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：让咪陪你追着球跑
You: Let Mate run after the ball with you.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.100
追球？咪准备好了。
Chase? Mii is ready.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.110
抓到你了！
Got you!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.680
咪抓到了。差点飞走。
Mii caught it. Almost flew.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：不玩了，我想去看电影
You: I don't want to play anymore. I want to go watch a movie.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.040
电影？咪有办法。
Movie? Mii has a plan.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.790
电影之夜。咪布置好了。
Movie night. Mii set it up.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.590
你看它的小短腿！
Look at its tiny legs!

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：我是要去电影院看电影，不是刷手机视频
You: I'm going to the cinema to watch a movie, not to scroll through phone videos.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:34.890
哎呀，要真的电影。咪懂了。
Oops. Real movie. Mii got it.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.920
开映啦。大银幕。咪弄好的。
Movie time. Big screen. Mii did it.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：让咪靠着你一起看
You: Let Mate lean on you and watch together.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.070
好呀，咪靠近你。
Okay. Mii leans close.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.180
咪给你留了点心。
Mii saved you a snack.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:03.480
最好的位置，就在你旁边。
Best seat. Next to you.
